pport statements, observed behavior).\n49\t- If no-go, the recommendation records what maturity signals must be met\n50\t  before the placement work is unblocked.\n51\t\n52\t## HLR Traceability\n53\t\n54\t- HLR-5 (P2, placement can prefer GPU-topology-aligned nodes when the cluster\n55\t  exposes topology information) — resolves whether HLR-5 is implemented this\n56\t  release at all.\n57\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-848d2e3aeea8b5ab","agent_id":"aa1173200b73ff1c1","session_id":"0becdb63-9a4f-4908-bf05-bc79d055671f","uuid":"fbcb8c93-37f8-49d8-981f-5379fc31b3c5","timestamp":"2026-10-08T16:40:00.825Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-af83249ca93ea90b","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9005 decomposition"}
