pport statements, observed behavior).\n49\t- If no-go, the recommendation records what maturity signals must be met\n50\t  before the placement work is unblocked.\n51\t\n52\t## HLR Traceability\n53\t\n54\t- HLR-5 (P2, placement can prefer GPU-topology-aligned nodes when the cluster\n55\t  exposes topology information) — resolves whether HLR-5 is implemented this\n56\t  release at all.\n57\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b01eb154d8d767e0","agent_id":"ae8a577ef2f9405e6","session_id":"0becdb63-9a4f-4908-bf05-bc79d055671f","uuid":"a631d3f1-be00-416e-9017-aa1de18d36a8","timestamp":"2026-10-08T17:11:54.259Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-828027964b6c6ef0","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9005 decomposition"}
