 job can see, in the Dashboard,\n54\t  the job's queue position, the project's quota consumption, and its\n55\t  admission state.\n56\t- The view is scoped to the user's projects and respects existing RBAC.\n57\t- The feature is gated by the Dashboard's feature-flag configuration and\n58\t  disabled by default if required by release policy.\n59\t- The Dashboard build pipeline is green.\n60\t\n61\t## HLR Traceability\n62\t\n63\t- HLR-3 (P1, users can see queue position, quota consumption, and admission\n64\t  state for pending jobs in the Dashboard) — fully covered by this epic.\n65\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b01eb154d8d767e0","agent_id":"ae8a577ef2f9405e6","session_id":"0becdb63-9a4f-4908-bf05-bc79d055671f","uuid":"e1592664-7ff6-4e78-8c3a-9d764d1f3a6a","timestamp":"2026-10-08T17:12:01.103Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-baaa46bd99504000","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9005 decomposition"}
