{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-91b24770ea09d19b","type":"tool_result","content":"# Dashboard\n\n**Jira component**: Dashboard\n**Maturity**: Stable (GA)\n**Owning team**: RHOAI Dashboard\n**Upstream**: opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard\n**Midstream**: red-hat-data-services/odh-dashboard\n**Konflux onboarded**: yes\n\n## Role in the platform\n\nSingle-pane web console for RHOAI. Surfaces data science projects, workbenches,\nmodel serving, pipelines, and distributed workload status. User-facing enablement\nof any component requires a Dashboard integration (navigation section, resource\nlists, creation/edit forms, status views).\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- OpenShift OAuth for authentication and project-scoped RBAC\n- Component backends via Kubernetes CRs (InferenceService, Notebook, PipelineRun,\n  Workload) — the Dashboard reads and writes CRs, it owns no data plane\n\n## Interfaces\n\n- Kubernetes API only; no private component APIs\n- Per-component feature flags and defaults via the OdhDashboardConfig CR\n# Training Operator\n\n**Jira component**: Training Operator\n**Maturity**: Stable (GA)\n**Owning team**: Distributed Workloads\n**Upstream**: kubeflow/training-operator\n**Midstream**: opendatahub-io/training-operator\n**Konflux onboarded**: yes\n\n## Role in the platform\n\nRuns distributed training jobs (PyTorchJob primarily) on the cluster. Multi-node\njobs are admitted through Kueue when workload queueing is enabled; the operator\nitself performs no scheduling beyond creating pods for the job topology.\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- Kueue (Distributed Workloads) for admission, quota, and gang semantics\n- GPU-enabled worker nodes (NVIDIA GPU Operator) for accelerated training\n\n## Interfaces\n\n- PyTorchJob CRD (kubeflow.org/v1)\n- Workload admission via kueue.x-k8s.io labels/queues\nDashboard\nData Science Pipelines\nDistributed Workloads\nDocumentation\nFeature Store\nKServe\nLlama Stack\nModel Registry\nNotebooks\nPlatform Operator\nServing Runtimes\nTraining Operator\nTrustyAI","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b01eb154d8d767e0","agent_id":"ae8a577ef2f9405e6","session_id":"0becdb63-9a4f-4908-bf05-bc79d055671f","uuid":"8a152d5d-f2a7-4645-8722-841a3c4e8cf9","timestamp":"2026-10-08T17:18:20.975Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-91b24770ea09d19b","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9005 decomposition"}
