implementation.\n- **Branch B — scheduler-plugin required**: Kueue semantics insufficient.\n  HLR-1 requires scheduler-plugin (e.g. coscheduling) work beyond Kueue,\n  integrated with Kueue quota (BRANCH-B-E008). Gate failure impact: `remove` —\n  if Kueue suffices, this work is unnecessary.\n\nBoth branch epics carry `branch`, `gated_by=RHAISTRAT-9005-E001`, and\n`gate_failure_impact` frontmatter; E001 is in each branch epic's\n`dependencies`. No main-plan epic lists a branch epic in its dependencies.\n\n## Health Warnings\n\n- **Missing strategy sections**: no Acceptance Criteria, no Dependencies\n  table, no Impacted Teams table, no NFRs (see Strategy Parsing Notes). Epic\n  acceptance criteria below were derived from HLRs and the problem statement;\n  a human should confirm they match intent.\n- **Component change detail absent**: the Affected Components list gives no\n  per-component change descriptions. Training Operator was classified passive\n  based on architecture context (admission flows through Kueue integration);\n  if the gang-admission investigation (branch B) reveals operator-side changes\n  are needed, a Training Operator epic should be added inside that branch.\n- **Priority consistency**: no inversions found — P0 admission/quota work is\n  gated by a P0 investigation; P1/P2 features are gated by same-priority\n  investigations.\n- **Scope trap (minor)**: HLR-5 depends on a Tech Preview capability; the\n  decomposition deliberately gates it on a maturity investigation rather than\n  assuming the Tech Preview API is buildable, to avoid ACs implying\n  infrastructure that may not be supported.\n\n## Tiered Delivery\n\nNo external dependency with uncertain timing exists (all uncertainty is\ninternal and modeled as investigation gates). Partial value still flows:\nHLR-2 (quota enforcement) and HLR-3 (Dashboard visibility) proceed in parallel\nwith the gang-admission investigation, so the strategy delivers\nquota-enforcement and visibility value even while HLR-1's approach is being\nresolved.\n","numLines":179,"startLine":1,"totalLines":179}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-91c5a25061d453cd","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
